            , { name = "today", type_ = "Date", description = "Today, supplied by the application (the library never reads the clock). It marks the day in the calendar, builds the standard quick choices, completes the short forms `20.10`, `t`, `+3` and `-7` in the text fields, and decides how a two-digit year is read.", control = Text }
